  "summary": "Architecture designed for adding a GET /api/v1/ping health check endpoint to backend/main.py. The change is purely additive, zero-risk to existing functionality, and requires no database, auth, or infrastructure changes. Framework is FastAPI or Flask (to be confirmed from main.py). A single route returning {\"status\": \"ok\", \"message\": \"pong\"} with HTTP 200 is the complete scope.",
