    "Ensure the route is registered before any catch-all or 404 handler if one exists in main.py.",
    "Test agent should assert: status_code == 200, Content-Type contains application/json, body equals {\"status\": \"ok\", \"message\": \"pong\"}.",
    "Do not alter any existing routes, middleware, or startup/shutdown hooks in main.py."
  ],
  "risks": [
    "Framework ambiguity (FastAPI vs Flask) \u2014 backend engineer must inspect main.py imports before writing code to avoid syntax mismatch.",
    "If /api/v1 prefix is already declared as a router/blueprint in main.py, the new /ping route must be added to that existing router rather than creating a duplicate prefix.",
    "Blast radius score of 40 flagged CRITICAL due to sandbox test file proliferation \u2014 actual production risk is LOW; sandbox test files should not be modified.",
    "If main.py uses a catch-all route or wildcard handler, route ordering must be verified to ensure /api/v1/ping is reachable."
